    "how": "The resource monitor's credit quota lowered to its used credits while a statement ran on the monitored warehouse, then restored. CREDIT_QUOTA takes whole credits only (0.01 was refused with 001008), and SYSTEM$WAIT holds no warehouse (the warehouse was suspended when the wait ended), so the third run computed with GENERATOR(TIMELIMIT => 540).",
